+# Vercel AI SDK runtime guidance
+
+`/src/support-agent.ts` passes the value returned by `buildRequest(prompt)` to `generateText`; that value configures `prepareStep` to return `instructions`. Static inspection cannot establish whether this indirect request shape and step-time instruction replacement are a supported direct SDK invocation pattern or which instructions become effective at runtime.
+
+Preserve this boundary until a source-owned SDK contract and a focused runtime test establish the behavior. If the boundary must be made explicit, use the documented direct `generateText({ ... })` pattern at the `supportAgent` call site and test the effective instructions against the pinned SDK.
